  "religion": {
    "_note": "Deity-names are NATIVE kami, independently coined (family_east_asian.json theonym_sets.japonic) - they do NOT borrow the Chinese forms (the tongues are unrelated) and are never real Shinto kami. Lawful/Chaotic: the Lawful keep the ordered way of the warrior (the kami of sun, blade and ancestors); the Chaotic the wild kami and the war-fury (the storm, the war-flame, the mountain-oni). The kami pervade all things; the ancestral dead (senzo) are honored at the household shrine.",
