      "1": "Miko (shrine-attendant)",
      "3": "Kannushi (shrine-priest)",
      "5": "Negi (senior priest)",
      "7": "Guji (chief priest)",
      "9": "Saishu (high priest of the realm)"
    },
    "demon_epithet_pattern": "the wild and devouring powers are fierce kami or oni, each with an epithet: Maraxus -> Takebi-no-kami the War-Flame; Vacidus -> Utsuro-no-kami the Devouring Void; Lusanto -> Kogane-Orochi the gold hoard-serpent.",
