    "saints_pattern": "great ancestors and fallen heroes enshrined as kami (the eirei, honored dead) at the clan jinja; 'the kami [name]'.",
    "sample_deity_renames": {
      "Gaiandus": "Iwane-no-kami (the Rock-Root, the enduring mountain)",
